        <activityName xml:lang="en">Barite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Barite, at plant
Rough estimation for the mining.;
CAS number: 007727-34-7; 
Formula: BaSO4; 
Synonyms: Bariumsulfat; 
UUID: 6218c61e-8520-3cbc-9d6f-bd6017757c52
Cradle to gate analysis of barite production including infrastructure, energy, water and estimation of particle emissions. Land use included in infrastructure.
Location: Publication in the US.
Technology: Resource extraction and processing of material.
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: 5.5 Mio. t in 1990.
Sampling: Literature. 
Extrapolations: From single data to European situation.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6218c61e-8520-3cbc-9d6f-bd6017757c52.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
